Session adoption (php-session + php-ext-session owners); needs vm-unserialize.diff. decode_with() runs php_var_unserialize semantics (unserialize_partial: no offset/extra-data warnings) with the VM's options, so warnings read "session_decode(): ..." (bug72663_3) and unserialize_max_depth applies; also forwards unserialize_enum_case.

